     "title": "Step 2",
     "description": "CP-5 is combined with sodium borohydride, magnesium chloride, and methanol, then filtered after the reaction completes. Hydrochloric acid is added to the filtrate, layers are settled and separated. Organic layer is distilled with ethanol, and the mixture is stirred with water. Resulting precipitate is filtered, rinsed and dried to yield CP-6.",
